## 10. Platform industrial tracks (post risk-closure)

After R-01..R-10 closure (`control:ci` SAFE), optional **Platform 9.5** tracks:

| Track | Guard / script | Scope |
| ----- | -------------- | ----- |
| **I0** | `guard-shell-appearance-ast.mjs` | AST scan of marketing / portal / admin shell TSX — no appearance `className` or Lucide `size`/`strokeWidth` |
| **I5** | `guard-api-lazy-plugin-registry.mjs` | API HTTP handlers load via generated `await import()` — no eager workspace handler shims |
| **I6** | `guard-surface-visual-matrix.mjs` + `test:smoke:visual:matrix` (marketing + portal) | Visual regression matrix: denali + urban + guest-club × marketing + portal shells. Portal urban/guest specs navigate via success-page `/me` link (same session contract as denali). Urban/guest portal snapshots optional until smoke servers capture baselines. |

I0 supersedes regex-only shell guards (`guard-admin-shell-i4`, `guard-admin-shell-chrome`) with a single TypeScript AST walker shared across surfaces.

